# Navigation & Routing (go_router)

## Centralize routing
- ✅ Define routes in `lib/app/router/`:
  - `app_router.dart` (`appRouterProvider`)
  - `app_routes.dart` (`AppRoutes` constants)
- ✅ Route paths are constants (`AppRoutes.*`); avoid magic strings in UI

## Params
- ✅ Prefer typed route parameters and validation
- ✅ Handle missing/invalid params with safe fallback pages

## Guards
- ✅ Auth/onboarding guards live in router `redirect` logic (single source of truth)
- ✅ Keep auth decisions based on provider state (e.g. `authSessionControllerProvider`)
- ✅ UI does not contain auth gate logic per screen (keep consistent)

## Navigation triggers
- ✅ Navigation is triggered by UI reacting to state/effects
- ❌ Do not call navigation in build

## Error handling
- ✅ Router `errorBuilder` should log via `AppLogger` and show a localized fallback message

## NEVER
- ❌ Push routes with hardcoded strings in random widgets
- ❌ Hide deep link handling inside feature widgets
